{"id":31636,"date":"2024-05-29T19:50:47","date_gmt":"2024-05-29T23:50:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/?page_id=31636"},"modified":"2026-03-05T17:06:11","modified_gmt":"2026-03-05T22:06:11","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"About Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center about-us-intro\"><strong>Welcome to Elevate Audiology &#8211; Hearing &amp; Tinnitus Center, home of Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Dr. Katelyn Ooms, and Dr. Khori Cioli.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity about-us-hr\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center about-us-ea\"><strong>At Elevate Audiology<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block about-us-list-fulewrapper is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns about-us-list-wrapper is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p><strong>We Are&#8230;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul id=\"about-us-list-col1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Committed to YOU&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Continuously learning for YOU&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trusted by your physicians&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Small, local, independent business&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Community focused&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Board-certified Doctors of Audiology&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tinnitus and sound sensitivity specialists<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Auditory Processing Specialists&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p><strong>We Offer&#8230;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list about-us-list-col2\">\n<li>Patient-centered pricing options&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Variety of hearing aid manufacturers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real ear measurements on hearing aid fittings&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Patient-Centered Care<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Telehealth Consultations<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tinnitus and Sound Sensitivity Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Auditory Processing Disorder Evaluations and Therapy<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image best-logo-img\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"364\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/awards-about-us.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32539\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:65px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large about-us-offices\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"330\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us-1280x330.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31639\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us-1280x330.png 1280w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us-768x198.png 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us-1536x396.png 1536w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us-600x155.png 600w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/office-about-us.png 1918w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block about-us-description is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Here at Elevate Audiology, we&#8217;re all about providing top-notch care in a warm and welcoming environment. Our dedicated staff and Doctors of Audiology don&#8217;t just treat hearing loss\u2014we&#8217;re experts in handling even the most complex cases.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But it&#8217;s not just about the technical stuff. Doctors Alexandra Tarvin, Katelyn Ooms, and Khori Cioli understand that your experience with us matters just as much as the care you receive. That&#8217;s why we&#8217;re committed to delivering 5-star service every time you walk through our doors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In our cutting-edge clinic, we take the time to truly listen to your concerns and work together to find solutions that fit your needs. Unlike typical hearing clinics, we believe in spending quality time with our patients\u2014more than double the average time, in fact!\u2028<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you choose Elevate Audiology, you&#8217;re not just getting exceptional care\u2014you&#8217;re becoming part of our family. We&#8217;re here to support you every step of the way on your journey to better hearing and a brighter future.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block about-us-vid-wrapper is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:34.6125rem\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introducing You to Elevate<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"Introducing you to Elevate Audiology | Greenville, SC and Easley, SC\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/aj8Cmx4Ucfk?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:34.6125rem\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Dr. Tarvin Chose Audiology<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"How I Found Audiology and Why I Love It! | Easley, SC and Greenville, SC\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/8wa3gbd5nMA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:60px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer spacer-before-vid\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center learn-why hide\"><strong>Learn why Dr. Tarvin chose audiology and how it still drives her to this day in this video.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image hide\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/8wa3gbd5nMA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/play-icon.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31640\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block about-us-mtt is-layout-flow wp-block-fuel-wrapper-block-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Meet Our Team<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:42px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/alex.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32839 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Dr. Alexandra Tarvin<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiologist<br>Tinnitus and Sound Sensitivity Specialist<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Au.D., the founder of Elevate Audiology, is a highly skilled audiologist dedicated to personalized patient care. With expertise in evaluating and treating hearing disorders, fitting hearing aids and advising on tinnitus management, she is recognized as a leading professional in the field.<br>&nbsp;<br>Dr. Tarvin earned her Doctor of Audiology from the University of South Florida and holds a bachelor\u2019s degree in communication sciences and disorders from the University of Florida.<br><br>Dr. Tarvin\u2019s commitment to advancing audiology knowledge is showcased through her&nbsp;published research and presentations at state and national conferences.<br>&nbsp;<br>As a certified fellow of the Tinnitus Practitioners Association and a member of the American Tinnitus Association, Dr. Tarvin specializes in tinnitus and sound sensitivity. Her dedication extends beyond clinical practice; she actively contributes to state and national professional organizations, volunteering in leadership roles and advocating for increased access to audiology services within the healthcare system at the state and federal level. She has been instrumental in developing an audiology clinic at the Samaritan Health Center in Pickens County, providing services to those that would otherwise not be able to receive them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Recognized for her advocacy efforts, Dr. Tarvin received an award in 2017 from the Academy of Doctors of Audiology. Her passion for enhancing audiology awareness and services is demonstrated through active participation in lobbying endeavors. Originally from Queens, NY, Dr. Tarvin resides in Greenville with her husband, a veteran, their son, Miles and their dog, Colby.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Tarvin is licensed to practice in South Carolina and North Carolina.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin was featured on the Hearing Matters Podcast in&nbsp;June. <a href=\"https:\/\/lnkd.in\/e97NEhpR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">You&nbsp;can listen to the full episode here<\/a>&nbsp;or <a href=\"https:\/\/lnkd.in\/etBrdgt6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">watch the full episode here<\/a>!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/katelyn.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32840 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Dr. Katelyn Ooms<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiologist<br>Auditory Processing Specialist<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hailing from Albany, New York, Dr. Katelyn Ooms earned her Doctor of Audiology from East Tennessee State University following her bachelor\u2019s degree in communication sciences and disorders from Bloomsburg University of Pennsylvania. She completed her clinical residency with us at Elevate Audiology from 2023-2024, where she quickly became a valued member of our team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Inspired by her early experiences learning sign language and connecting with the Deaf community, Dr. Ooms has devoted her career to serving individuals with hearing loss. She has developed a special focus on auditory processing disorders, bringing these much-needed diagnostic and treatment services to our community. Additionally, she works closely with our veterans and generously volunteers her expertise at the local Samaritan Health Clinic, providing compassionate care to underserved populations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside the clinic, Dr. Ooms enjoys relaxing with her fluffy cat, Hiro, and sharing laughs with her family during online board game nights.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avt-khori-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32290 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Dr. Khori Cioli<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiologist<br>Tinnitus Specialist<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Originally from Poughkeepsie, New York, Dr. Khori Cioli earned Doctor of Audiology from the State University of New York at Buffalo. She earned her bachelor\u2019s degree in communication disorders from SUNY New Paltz, where she cultivated her passion for helping others through personalized care.&nbsp;She completed her clinical residency with us at Elevate Audiology from 2024-2025, where she learned from our team.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With her naturally calming demeanor, Dr. Cioli brings a thoughtful, patient-centered approach to audiology. She has developed a particular interest in tinnitus care and management, regularly completing advanced training to support patients in navigating the challenges of tinnitus and improving their quality of life. Her focused training in the clinic was was under Dr. Alexandra Tarvin. Her dedication to counseling and creating individualized care plans allows her to connect deeply with patients, empowering them to achieve better outcomes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When she\u2019s not in the clinic, Dr. Cioli enjoys expressing her creativity through art and cherishing time with friends and family.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"806\" height=\"1048\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/capecexl-11.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32906 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/capecexl-11.webp 806w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/capecexl-11-768x999.webp 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/capecexl-11-600x780.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Dr. Scott Capece<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiologist<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Originally from Easley, Dr. Scott Capece brings both clinical expertise and personal understanding to his work as an audiologist. He earned his Bachelor of Science in Biology from the University of South Carolina and his Doctor of Audiology from the University of Louisville.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Capece\u2019s path into audiology began early. As a child, he experienced recurring ear issues, giving him firsthand insight into how hearing challenges can affect confidence, communication and daily life. That experience shaped the way he practices today\u2014with empathy, patience and a genuine desire to help people feel heard and supported.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Capece will be seeing patients at our&nbsp;<strong>Greenville location<\/strong>, where he is excited to serve the community and help expand access to best-practice hearing care in the area.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>He has a special interest in hearing aid technology and enjoys walking alongside patients through every step of their hearing journey\u2014from the initial evaluation to selecting the right technology, to ongoing care and fine-tuning. For Dr. Capece, it\u2019s not just about improving hearing test results. It\u2019s about helping people reconnect with conversations, relationships and the moments that matter most.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Education is a core part of his approach. He believes patients deserve clear explanations, transparent options and a personalized plan that fits their lifestyle and goals. His hope is that every person who sits in his chair leaves feeling informed, confident and empowered in their care.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside of the office, Dr. Capece enjoys spending time with family and friends, golfing, playing guitar and hiking with his dog.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/avt-jaymee-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32291 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Jaymee Morgan<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiology Assistant<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Jaymee Morgan is our Audiology Assistant. She was born in Easley and graduated from Pickens High School. Jaymee furthered her education at Greenville Technical College, where she received an associate degree in business management. She completed her Audiologist\u2019s Assistant certificate from Nova Southeastern University in October 2023. She has several years of customer service experience as well as a passion for non-profit and volunteer work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside of the office, you can find Jaymee spending time with her pets and partner, working on a craft project or finding new ways to enjoy the outdoors.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"806\" height=\"1048\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/shannon-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32912 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/shannon-1.png 806w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/shannon-1-768x999.png 768w, https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/shannon-1-600x780.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Shannon Williamson<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Audiology Assistant<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Shannon is our Audiology Assistant in Easley and a proud native of upstate South Carolina. Her journey in patient-centered care began with six years as a Newborn Hearing Screen Coordinator, where she discovered her passion for supporting patients and families with compassion and dedication.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Shannon brings her warm spirit and strong communication skills to every interaction, helping our patients feel comfortable and confident throughout their visit. Whether she\u2019s greeting you at the front desk or assisting during appointments, Shannon\u2019s genuine care for others is always evident.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside of work, Shannon is a proud mom to her two sons, Christopher and Seth, and her stepson, JR. She also loves spending time with her two beloved dogs, Sunny and Otis. In her free time, you\u2019ll often find her capturing memories through photography, trying out new baking recipes, exploring the outdoors, traveling, or enjoying a good concert.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/amanda-james.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32828 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Amanda James<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Patient Care Coordinator<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Amanda James joined Elevate Audiology in January 2026 as a Patient Care Coordinator. Originally from Charleston, South Carolina, she now resides in Greenville and brings a strong background in both customer service and healthcare to our team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Amanda is passionate about creating a welcoming, supportive experience for every patient and family she serves. Her attention to detail and compassionate approach helps ensure each visit runs smoothly from start to finish.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside of the office, Amanda is a proud mom of four and loves spending time with her children and family. In her free time, she also enjoys vlogging and capturing everyday moments that matter most.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top about-us-mtt-medtex\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"380\" height=\"494\" src=\"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/eliza.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-32835 size-full\"\/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-name\">Eliza Young<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"about-us-bio-title\">Patient Care Coordinator<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Born in New York City and raised in Mauldin, South Carolina, Eliza is a graduate of Mauldin High School and is currently continuing her education in Business Management. She brings over 12 years of customer service experience to Elevate Audiology, along with a genuine passion for helping others and giving back to her community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Eliza is known for her welcoming presence and thoughtful attention to detail, helping ensure each patient feels supported from the moment they walk through the door. Her background in customer service allows her to create positive, meaningful experiences for patients and their families.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Outside of the office, Eliza enjoys spending time with her son, Samael, and working alongside her mother on DIY home projects. She also loves traveling, cooking, and baking whenever she gets the chance.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Welcome to Elevate Audiology &#8211; Hearing &amp; Tinnitus Center, home of Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Dr. Katelyn Ooms, and Dr. Khori Cioli. At Elevate Audiology Learn why Dr. Tarvin chose audiology and how it still drives her to this day in this video. Dr. Alexandra Tarvin AudiologistTinnitus and Sound Sensitivity Specialist Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Au.D., the&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page_fullwidth.php","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","schema":"","fname":"","lname":"","position":"","credentials":"","placeID":"","no_match":false,"name":"","company":"","review":"","address":"","city":"","state":"","zip":"","lat":"","lng":"","phone1":"","phone2":"","fax":"","mon1":"","mon2":"","tue1":"","tue2":"","wed1":"","wed2":"","thu1":"","thu2":"","fri1":"","fri2":"","sat1":"","sat2":"","sun1":"","sun2":"","hours-note":"","footnotes":""},"service_tags":[],"class_list":["post-31636","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/31636","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=31636"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/31636\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":32915,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/31636\/revisions\/32915"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=31636"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"service_tags","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevate